        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG110, Stainless Steel Abbeyville Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe AHI made SIG110 has a round rose and a square flat grip which mounts at the rose is at a 90 degree angle. This is a great addition to match other modern hardware in your home. The stainless steel lever is very comfortable to handle and resistant to nicks, scratches or abrasions. Durable in appearance and function even after many years of use on your home or office. The Stainless Steel Abbeyville Leverset is ADA compliant. It will fit standard 2-1/8\" door cut outs. Available for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. Adjustable for door thicknesses from 1-3/8\" to 2\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG-210-specification.gif?v=1704354515\" width=\"568\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"SIG 2110 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Stainless Steel AHI SIG110 Abbeyville Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For residential or commercial applications</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors)</li>\r\n<li>Field reversible tubular latch</li>\r\n<li>Premium latch requires only 28° rotation to retract latchbolt</li>\r\n<li>Meets standards of the <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the SIG110 Abbeyville Stainless Steel Lever With Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-15/16\" (126 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Style: flat</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\" (57 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Spindle Width: 0.31\" (8 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/16\" (62 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/8\" (10 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a door pull or to match trim. Trim is on one side of door. Lever is surface mounted (mounting plate screws to the doors face).</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. For use with a standard 2-1/8\" bore hole pre-drilled door. </li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Stainless Steel Abbeyville Leverset, AHI SIG110",
                "description": "AHI SIG110, Stainless Steel Abbeyville Leverset - The AHI made SIG110 has a round rose and a square flat grip which mounts at the rose is at a 90 degree angle. This is a great addition to match other modern hardware in your home. The stainless steel lever is very comfortable to handle and resistant to nicks, scratches or abrasions. Durable in appearance and function even after many years of use on your home or office. The Stainless Steel Abbeyville Leverset is ADA compliant. It will fit standard 2-1/8 inch door cut outs. Available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Adjustable for door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches.",
                "keywords": "AHI-SIG110, AHI SIG110, ada compliant levers, modern door levers, contemporary door levers, safety code compliant levers, ahi sigma line levers, Stainless Steel Abbeyville Leversets, Stainless Steel Abbeyville Door Levers,"
